{"id":"ce118b25d2b12cdc","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded.md","title":"可及部分是最大向下闭良基部分","display":"thm-accessible-part-well-founded — 可及部分是最大向下闭良基部分","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded","aliases":["72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded"],"display":"thm-accessible-part-well-founded — 可及部分是最大向下闭良基部分","depends_on":["[[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]","[[72-df-transfinite-induction]]","[[72-thm-inductive-fixed-point]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.2, print270–271/PDF282–283; local least-fixed-point argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"统一新增原子的显示数学界定符"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-accessible-part-well-founded — 可及部分是最大向下闭良基部分"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"839f229fc9fb3b6f\" href=\"?note=839f229fc9fb3b6f\" title=\"72-df-accessible-ordinal\">72-df-accessible-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a118aa517b30e4d\" href=\"?note=7a118aa517b30e4d\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-induction\">72-df-transfinite-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cee8253e7f3f324a\" href=\"?note=cee8253e7f3f324a\" title=\"72-thm-inductive-fixed-point\">72-thm-inductive-fixed-point</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.2, print270–271/PDF282–283; local least-fixed-point argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"统一新增原子的显示数学界定符"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(O,\\prec)\">\\((O,\\prec)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\prec,\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\">\\(\\Phi_\\prec,\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"839f229fc9fb3b6f\" href=\"?note=839f229fc9fb3b6f\" title=\"72-df-accessible-ordinal\">72-df-accessible-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7a118aa517b30e4d\" href=\"?note=7a118aa517b30e4d\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-induction\">72-df-transfinite-induction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Down}\">\\(\\operatorname{Down}\\)</span> 在下式局部定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq O\">\\(B\\subseteq O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_B:=\\prec\\cap B^2\">\\(R_B:=\\prec\\cap B^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:=\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\">\\(A:=\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec):\\Longleftrightarrow B\\subseteq O\\land\\forall a\\in B\\ \\forall b\\in O\\ (b\\prec a\\Rightarrow b\\in B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec):\\Longleftrightarrow B\\subseteq O\\land\\forall a\\in B\\ \\forall b\\in O\\ (b\\prec a\\Rightarrow b\\in B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{Down}(A;O,\\prec),\\qquad\\mathrm{WF}(A,\\prec\\cap A^2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{Down}(A;O,\\prec),\\qquad\\mathrm{WF}(A,\\prec\\cap A^2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(B,R_B)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\subseteq A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(B,R_B)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\subseteq A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup\\{B\\subseteq O:\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(B,\\prec\\cap B^2)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A=\\bigcup\\{B\\subseteq O:\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(B,\\prec\\cap B^2)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\prec\">\\(\\Phi_\\prec\\)</span> 单调，既有最小前不动点定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A\">\\(\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A\\)</span>；固定点等式也使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 前驱闭合。若非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq A\">\\(X\\subseteq A\\)</span> 没有前驱极小元，则每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> 有前驱仍在X中，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\prec(O\\setminus X)\\subseteq O\\setminus X\">\\(\\Phi_\\prec(O\\setminus X)\\subseteq O\\setminus X\\)</span>。最小性迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq O\\setminus X\">\\(A\\subseteq O\\setminus X\\)</span>，矛盾，因此限制关系良基。对向下闭良基 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 作关系归纳：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in B\">\\(b\\in B\\)</span> 的全部前驱都在B中且由归纳假设在A中，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A\">\\(b\\in\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A\\)</span>。最后的并式由两个方向合并；向下闭条件不可省略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-accessible-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"839f229fc9fb3b6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-inductive-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"cee8253e7f3f324a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-inductive-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-accessible-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"839f229fc9fb3b6f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(O,\\prec)$ 与 $\\Phi_\\prec,\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec$ 取 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]]；$\\operatorname{Down}$ 在下式局部定义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(O,\\prec)$ 与 $\\Phi_\\prec,\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec$ 取 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]]；$\\operatorname{Down}$ 在下式局部定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(O,\\prec)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_\\prec,\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Down}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq O","display":false},{"tex":"R_B:=\\prec\\cap B^2","display":false},{"tex":"A:=\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec):\\Longleftrightarrow B\\subseteq O\\land\\forall a\\in B\\ \\forall b\\in O\\ (b\\prec a\\Rightarrow b\\in B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A,\\qquad\\operatorname{Down}(A;O,\\prec),\\qquad\\mathrm{WF}(A,\\prec\\cap A^2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(B,R_B)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ B\\subseteq A.","display":true},{"tex":"A=\\bigcup\\{B\\subseteq O:\\operatorname{Down}(B;O,\\prec)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(B,\\prec\\cap B^2)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_\\prec(O\\setminus X)\\subseteq O\\setminus X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq O\\setminus X","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\Phi_\\prec(A)=A","display":false}],"bytes":2201,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c9094f9aaf890d2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(O,\\prec)$ 与 $A:=\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec$ 取 [[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded]]；限制关系已良基且A向下闭。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded|thm-accessible-part-well-founded — 可及部分是最大向下闭良基部分]]"},{"id":"eb639084525fd226","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(O,\\prec)$、$\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec$ 与 $\\mathrm{WF}$ 同 [[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded]]；不预先假设 $O$ 非空、线性有序或为序数记号系统。"}],"outgoing":["839f229fc9fb3b6f","7a118aa517b30e4d","cee8253e7f3f324a"]}